        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash the power of music in <i>Melodic Mage</i>, a 2D pixel art action shooter where every attack and dodge must follow the rhythm! Play as a wizard battling through dynamic levels, casting spells, dashing, and dodging—<i>all in sync with the beat</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎵 <strong>Rhythm-Based Combat</strong> – Cast spells and dodge enemy attacks in sync with the music.<br>🧙‍♂️ <strong>Magical Arsenal</strong> – Unlock and choose between different mages.<br>⚔️ <strong>Challenging Enemies &amp; Bosses</strong> – Conquer diverse levels, each with their own final boss.<br>🎶 <strong>Hard mode </strong>– For those looking for a challenge, the hard mode will punish you every time you miss a beat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the rhythm. Control the magic. <i>Become the Melodic Mage!</i></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash the power of music in <i>Melodic Mage</i>, a 2D pixel art action shooter where every attack and dodge must follow the rhythm! Play as a wizard battling through dynamic levels, casting spells, dashing, and dodging—<i>all in sync with the beat</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎵 <strong>Rhythm-Based Combat</strong> – Cast spells and dodge enemy attacks in sync with the music.<br>🧙‍♂️ <strong>Magical Arsenal</strong> – Unlock and choose between different mages.<br>⚔️ <strong>Challenging Enemies &amp; Bosses</strong> – Conquer diverse levels, each with their own final boss.<br>🎶 <strong>Hard mode </strong>– For those looking for a challenge, the hard mode will punish you every time you miss a beat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the rhythm. Control the magic. <i>Become the Melodic Mage!</i></p>",
        "short_description": "A rhythm-based action shooter where you play as a mage, casting spells and dodging to the beat. Battle through dynamic levels, defeat challenging bosses, and unleash the magic of music!",
